  "version": "1",
  "text": "Your look is built around the rich chocolate sweater and grey trousers, with a sleek black blazer to wear over or take off at work. A pair of cozy black loafers ground your steps on the office floor, while a vibrant terracotta bag adds a warm pop that brightens even the most neutral days.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the black blazer open when you move between rooms to keep things light and fluid throughout your day.",
    "Leave the chocolate sweater untucked over the grey trousers to let it hang soft, drawing the eye up toward your face.",
    "Hold the terracotta bag in hand or on a low shoulder for ease as you rush between meetings."
  ],
