  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#170·32",
      "text": "The chocolate sweater is a soft knit with a neat half-turtleneck and short sleeves, cut to sit relaxed over your body without clinging. Its deep brown tone feels warm and inviting against the grey trousers."
    },
    {
      "n": "#58·33",
      "text": "The grey trousers have a high waist and a straight leg that falls gently to the ankle, offering a clean line that balances the softness of your sweater. They are tailored but not stiff, perfect for all-day comfort."
    },
    {
      "n": "#168·10",
      "text": "The black loafers are suede with plush shearling lining and a flat gum sole, giving you quiet warmth and ease as you walk through the office. The subtle gold detail on the vamp adds just enough polish."
    },
    {
      "n": "#390·02",
      "text": "The terracotta bag has a pebbled leather texture and a structured shape with a top handle and side straps that can be used in many ways. Its rich orange hue stands out beautifully against your neutral tones."
    },
    {
      "n": "#80·33",
      "text": "The black blazer is made of smooth fabric with two buttons, notched lapels, and functional pockets. It cuts straight down to the hip, offering a clean silhouette that works perfectly over your sweater or alone."
    }
  ]
}
